    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n104027" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τίνα</span></b>  (= Lat. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>tina</i> 'wine-vessel'?), in acc. sg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τίναν</span>, 
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιτάδα</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				Alex.Trall.
				<u>Febr.</u>
				2
			</span></i>; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιτίδα</span> (acc. of
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιτίς</span>, q.v.) may be
			conjectured.</div>
